WEBVTT

00:26:30.016 --> 00:26:33.492
and I, you know,
at my 30th birthday was in tears

00:26:33.516 --> 00:26:34.800
that I hadn't accomplished

00:26:34.824 --> 00:26:37.492
what I wanted to accomplish
yet with my life.

00:26:37.516 --> 00:26:39.127
AG: But she didn't rush it.

00:26:39.151 --> 00:26:42.423
Instead, for the next 10 years,
she kept chugging along,

00:26:42.447 --> 00:26:45.809
testing out different ways
to build and use her skills.

00:26:45.833 --> 00:26:49.749
Finally, the year of her next
big birthday, she created a website.

00:26:50.119 --> 00:26:53.329
Lynda called her site Lynda.com.

00:26:53.353 --> 00:26:55.571
LW: Well, when we started
Lynda.com I was 40

00:26:55.595 --> 00:26:57.726
and when we sold it I was 60.

00:26:57.750 --> 00:27:00.322
AG: She sold it in 2015 to LinkedIn,